      <title>美联储主席寻求平息对通胀加剧的担忧</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/28/business/fed-kevin-warsh-speech-inflation.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[凯文·沃什 (Kevin M. Warsh) 在一次高调演讲中表示，美联储对抑制通胀负有主要责任。如果物价上涨没有很快回到央行的目标，“我们还有工作要做，”他说。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/28/business/fed-kevin-warsh-speech-inflation.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Fri, 28 Aug 2026 14:39:40 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
